⍝ Test runner used by `dyalog test`. Runs Tester.Run on a folder or file and
⍝ exits with 0 (all passed), 1 (failures or errors) or 2 (runner problem).
⍝   dyalogscript run-tests.apls [/app/path]
args←2⎕NQ'.' 'GetCommandLineArgs'
here←⊃1⎕NPARTS⊃args
path←{1<≢⍵:2⊃⍵ ⋄ '/app'}args
:Trap 0
    {}⎕FIX'file://',here,'Tester.apln'
    code←Tester.Run path
:Else
    ⎕←'dyalog test: ',⎕DMX.EM,(×≢⎕DMX.Message)/': ',⎕DMX.Message
    code←2
:EndTrap
⍝ Keep ⎕OFF on its own line: `⎕OFF expression` on one line exits before
⍝ the expression runs.
⎕OFF code
